WEBVTT

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:33.890
<i>Introduction to Swordcraft</i>?

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:36.860
What, you gonna learn to swing a sword
and become a military officer?

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:36.180
Excuse me!

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:37.960
No way.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:40.000
Oh, the books you asked for are here.

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:41.950
Let's see here...

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.000
<i>Introductory Sexual Techniques </i>and
<i>The Illustrated Guide to Sexual Positions</i>.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.930
You don't need to read the titles aloud!

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:52.880
Here you are.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.080
Thank you!

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:59.150
Did you hear? Kousonsan got a far
better sword than she deserves.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.760
Kousonsan?

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:01.520
Who's that?

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.560
You know, the Yuushuu viceroy who calls
herself the "White Horse General."

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.870
Oh, the one that everyone forgets about.

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:17.430
From what I heard, she found an amazing sword
in the lair of some bandits she took out.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.870
She's sure it must be some famous weapon.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.270
Thanks for your patronage.

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:22.360
I'll be back!

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:23.200
Looking forward to it!

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.400
Anyway, you hear about
the three Chou sisters?

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.830
They're really popular!

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.310
I'm back!

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:32.760
Welcome back.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:38.260
But did you really have to leave
us to go to a bookstore?

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.150
We would have gone with you.

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:44.760
Well, you know, I didn't want to make everyone
sit around while I did my thing.

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:52.540
<b>Episode 2
Ryuubi Visits
Touka Village</b>

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.740
Who are you?

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:05.110
I don't have any money.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:09.000
That's true. You don't look like
you have anything valuable.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:14.170
But you do have some pretty good
stuff to make up for it!

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.790
Wh-What are you going to do?

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:22.160
Nothing that hurts. Don't be scared.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:26.820
Yeah, it'll actually feel pretty good.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.430
If you get any closer,
I'll use this straw mat to...

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.800
To do what?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.350
Give up.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.130
See!

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:46.040
You don't know where I am now!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:47.580
That's not going to hide you...

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.610
Don't screw with us!

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.540
That's as far as you go!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.250
Who the hell are you?

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.430
As a final gift before your
deaths, I will tell you.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:06.090
This is the girl famed for her lush,
natural hair "down there"...

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.160
<b>Please Wait a Moment</b>

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:11.120
As a final gift before your
deaths, I will tell you.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:15.950
This is the famous black-haired bandit hunter, who brings
comfort to the weak and terror to the strong!

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.470
You're...

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:21.090
B-Boss!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:27.500
Fine! We'll shave off your famous hair
and make you nice and shiny!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.680
It's not famous, damn it!

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:32.220
Get her!

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.330
With one swing?

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:41.780
But it feels good...

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.540
Jeez, we finally got rid of them.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:45.400
Yes.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.880
Our heroics have brought peace
to the land once more.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:52.760
Shuri, you can come out!

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.100
My pot of boiled bamboo
shoots is OK, right?

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:58.100
Yes, it hasn't broken or anything.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:05.330
You didn't fight at all, but you should be more worried
about the bump on your head than your pot.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.360
Aisha doesn't have any fun.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:09.070
Can you stand up?

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:13.220
Yes. Thank you for saving me!

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.040
It was nothing.

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:16.510
That's right.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:20.510
Those guys were no match
for the mighty Rin Rin!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:22.620
You didn't fight at all, either.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:27.320
But you were so badly hurt saving me...

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:33.520
Aisha, is this where you say
something sarcastic?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.500
Don't ask me!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:40.850
Anyway, I thought we'd taken out
all the bandits around here.

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:45.050
I had no idea guys like that were still
lurking around Touka Village.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.220
That's true.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:50.160
Most likely, they're just thieves that
came from some other area.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:54.180
We should probably tell the
villagers to look out.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.610
Um...

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:59.630
Do you live in Touka Village?

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:00.650
We do.

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:01.970
Oh, good!

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:08.200
I was on my way there, but those
scary people attacked me.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.680
I see. That must have been awful.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.390
But don't worry.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.440
You're almost there.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.870
We'll take you there.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:20.820
Thank you for everything.

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:26.080
I'm sorry. My name is Ryuubi.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:27.770
My style name is Gentoku.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.520
Ryuubi?

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:30.870
Gentoku...

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:39.180
Now then, an explanation for viewers
watching for the first time.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:44.590
The original creator of the Touka Village
peasant army was a man, Ryuubi,

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:48.460
who claimed to be a descendant of the
legendary emperor Chuuzan Seiou.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:57.030
Deeply impressed by his desire for a peaceful
world, Kan'u decided to fight alongside him,

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:58.900
but he was a fraud!

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:04.280
His talk of righteousness was mere talk,

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:08.540
and his true nature was that
of a despicable man

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:11.730
who thought nothing of sacrificing the
peasantry for his own advancement!

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:16.900
Kan'u and her friends refused to work with
such a villain and cut their ties to him.

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:27.120
And then they discovered that he was the leader of a
group which had once kidnapped Kouchuu's daughter!

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:33.670
As soon as this became known,
he fled for the hills in terror!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:42.440
I see. So he was claiming
to be me, after all.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.640
It must be him, then.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.510
Him?

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:49.720
Do you know him?

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:54.160
Yes. Actually, I once lived
with my elderly mother,

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:59.770
and we made our living by weaving straw
mats and selling them in nearby villages.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:03.030
But one day, on my way back
from selling my mats,

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.600
as I rested at a mountain ridge tea stand,

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:09.840
the young man next to me spoke to me.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:12.420
Miss.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:19.560
If you don't mind, could I briefly
see the weapon you carry?

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.610
Sure, but...

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.070
Ooh...

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.830
Amazing.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.060
What a splendid blade!

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:32.430
The blade sparkles in the sun,
and the scabbard is so well-made!

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:34.610
And this jewel at the tip...

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.960
What a wonderful blade!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:41.770
He praised it so much, I found I
was smiling in spite of myself.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:45.250
And I accidentally told him that the blade
had been in my family for generations,

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:49.750
proving its bearer to be Chuuzan
Seiou's descendant.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:53.720
Chuuzan Seiou?

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.680
Yes. We have a chart of our family tree,

00:08:55.680 --> 00:09:01.220
and if you go back several generations, you'll
find Chuuzan Seiou Ryuushou's name.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:06.910
I left the tea stand, walked for a while,
and found myself on a lonely cliff path.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.640
The man from before followed me...

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:17.160
I'm sorry, but would you show
me that blade again?

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.020
Sure, I guess...

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:26.870
You really can believe this sword's
associated with Chuuzan Seiou.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.850
The more I look at it, the more I like it...

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:34.750
By the way, Ryuubi-dono, you told
me your name back there.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.640
Would you tell me your style name as well?

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.100
It's Gentoku.

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:41.400
Ryuubi Gentoku?

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.930
That sounds nice.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:43.930
Thanks.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.550
Now then...

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:50.140
I will take this sword and name for myself!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:04.360
Fortunately, a branch caught
me as I fell, and I was saved.

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:08.400
But when I returned home and told
my mother what had happened...

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:14.270
Dear, your mother has always taught
you about our ancestors, yes?

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.200
And that when the time comes,
you must take your blade

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:20.460
and leave the village on a journey
to make the world a better place?

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:21.360
Yes.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:25.430
<i>Pathetic!</i>

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:29.530
You had the precious blade which has, for generations,
held our ancestors' will, stolen...

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.130
and you returned without it!

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.350
My mother became enraged,

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:39.690
grabbed my neck, and threw me into the
Bantou River flowing by our house.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:48.500
After that, every time she remembered it,
she would grab me and throw me into the river.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.640
Wh-What an interesting mother you have...

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:03.150
Just when I was thinking that I wasn't going
to last, that I would someday drown,

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:08.720
I heard rumors of someone with the same name as
mine leading a peasant army in Touka Village.

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:16.710
I see. So you thought the person who stole your sword
must be using your name, and you came here.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:23.610
I wasn't that certain, but I
had no other clues. So I-

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.540
Ryuubi, prepare to die!

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.650
Oh, my. I see...

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.610
I'm sorry.

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:48.250
The villagers said that "Ryuubi" was here,
so all the blood just went to my head...

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:50.090
I really am sorry.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:53.530
No, I was just a bit surprised.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:59.050
But I'll never forgive the man
who was using your name.

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:03.740
If I ever find him, I'll tear off his ears, slice
off his nose, and smash in his eyes.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:07.990
Then I'll take my time, ripping off his fingernails
one by one, then fillet him,

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.340
then make little cuts all down one
side of his body and steam him,

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:14.000
and then boil his bones in oil...

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.870
Sh-Shion, you're scaring the heck
out of everyone, so please stop.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:25.980
If only I'd forced myself to chase and catch him,
we would've been able to get her sword back, too.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:28.380
It can't be helped.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:31.860
You didn't know the situation then.

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:35.470
Um, I remembered something when
you were talking about swords...

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:40.450
Actually, when I was at the book
store today, I heard something.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:46.630
<i>Kousonsan-san from Yuushuu
found an amazing sword</i>...

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:48.400
Maybe that was it!

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.620
Kousonsan... Kousonsan...

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.360
Oh, Hakukei-chan!

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:57.340
Ryuubi-san, you know Kousonsan-san ?

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:01.970
Yeah, we once studied under
the same teacher.

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.550
Kousonsan?

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.640
I've heard that name somewhere...

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:06.930
I can't remember!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.870
Sei, you're doing that deliberately.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:14.540
Man, I've been sneezing all day today...

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.880
I bet someone's spreading
rumors about me!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:22.720
I've started to become famous
as the White Horse General.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:26.880
Ever since I found this sword,
luck's come my way!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:36.810
I don't know if the sword she found
in the bandits' lair is yours,

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:41.120
but if you don't have any clues,
it's worth asking, isn't it?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:45.510
If the sword is yours, and the person
who has it is someone you know,

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.490
once you tell them the story,
they're sure to give it back.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:50.390
That's right.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:54.400
Then I guess I'll go and try
visiting Hakukei-chan.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:59.300
But if you leave now, you'll never make
it over the mountains before sunset.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:02.830
Camping outside in the mountains is dangerous,
especially when you're alone.

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.780
Why don't you stay here tonight?

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:08.530
But I don't want to impose.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.100
It's fine, really.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:12.500
I'll make a delicious dinner for you!

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:17.210
Even if I didn't really know you, I was still rude.
Allow me to make it up to you.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.160
Very well, then-

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.390
Ryuubi, prepare to die!

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:24.400
Huh?

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.660
Who are you...

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.740
I haven't had a real bath in ages!

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:38.820
Look at me! I'm a fish!

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:40.470
Let's see...

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:43.420
The one with the pretty, long
black hair is Kan'u-san.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.420
The smart little kid is Koumei-chan.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:50.270
And the one who isn't is Rin Rin... No, Chouhi-chan.

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:53.140
Chou'un-san's the one with a strange,
hard-to-describe aura to her,

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:57.540
and the one with the biggest breasts is Kouchuu-san.
And her daughter is Riri-chan.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.340
And then Bachou-san!

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:02.660
I'm glad they were all such nice people.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:12.050
OK, everyone. Thank you.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:16.520
Be careful on your way, so you're
not attacked by bandits.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.770
Right!

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:23.820
But even if I'm kinda out of it, I'm not stupid
enough to get attacked all the time!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:26.850
No, that's not what I meant...

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.230
Be well!

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:30.530
All of you, too!

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:34.650
Stay put!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.700
We screwed up yesterday, but today...

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:41.910
That's as far as you go!

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.860
You again?!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.120
That's my line!

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:50.840
How dare you continue your evil deeds?

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:55.090
This time, your blood shall stain
my Seiryuu Engetsutou!

00:15:56.060 --> 00:16:02.070
I'm glad you're getting into this, but you know what's
going to happen if you try something, right?

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.020
Cowards!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.590
What's wrong?

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.930
You can't do anything at all
while we've got a hostage?

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:10.420
Amazing, Boss!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.220
You're like a real villain!

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:16.530
Now I'm going to pay you back for
everything, including yesterday!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:17.900
That's it!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.220
Who are you?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.220
At times, a traveling warrior who
loves her bamboo shoots.

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:32.590
At other times, a mysterious bare-naked
beauty in the flower-filled hot springs.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.920
But her true identity is...

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.840
a lone butterfly dancing through
the war-torn world!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:41.380
The messenger of beauty and
justice, Butterfly Mask!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:49.060
Villains, now is your chance to give up.

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:51.180
What are you talking about?

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:53.270
We've got a hostage.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:17:00.110
Very well. This was the one technique
I didn't want to use, but...

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.720
Secret Technique: Shadow Clones!

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:10.370
Boss, the mask chick... She's multiplying!

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.640
Don't be scared. It's just an illusion!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.350
Wh-What?

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.420
What's she going to do?

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:27.270
D-Dizzy...

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:30.840
Now!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:33.540
Why, you...

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:35.370
You're OK now.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:36.520
Thank you!

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.500
Are you hurt?

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.700
I'm all right, Butterfly Mask-sama...

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:46.380
She forced the enemy into a situation that stunned
them into inaction, and then she struck.

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:50.160
A brilliant plan that uses an advanced
knowledge of human psychology.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.130
A-Are you serious, Shuri?

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:56.560
No, I'm kidding.

00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:58.520
That's not fair, you coward!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:17:59.380
Yeah!

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:03.230
How dare you call the messenger
of beauty and justice a coward?

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:07.800
Atone for your insults toward
the Butterfly Mask in hell!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.510
<i>Get him, my underlings!</i>

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:12.130
Why are we her underlings?

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:16.880
I understand how you feel, but for now,
we need to get those bandits!

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:18.060
That's right.

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.370
Aisha, pound them flat!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.860
Jeez...

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:25.730
I won't let you get us twice!

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:33.590
Ag-ai-n?

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:37.930
Take that!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.740
Where are the bandits?

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:45.270
Kan'u-san and her friends got them.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:47.160
I'm late?

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.630
Wh-What do we do?

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:54.080
We should play along, I think.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.780
Yeah, I don't want her getting upset later.

00:18:56.780 --> 00:19:00.930
Come to think of it, you were held hostage
by the bandits, weren't you?

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.740
How did you escape?

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:09.700
A super-cool person called Butterfly Mask
appeared and saved me from them!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:11.580
Cool?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.670
Oh, I see.

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:19.630
I wanted, at least, to say thanks,
but she vanished before I could...

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:23.900
So, she's not only super-cool,
but she vanished before you could thank her.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:27.130
I'm sure she's a very humble person.

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:28.380
How can she say that?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:31.710
That beautiful, noble form...

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:35.350
I'm sure she must be beautiful
under her mask, as well.

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:37.290
I see, I see...

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:40.820
The Butterfly Mask was that
noble and beautiful, huh?

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.290
Yes!

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:43.750
Hey, Aisha.

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:46.290
These are dangerous times.

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:49.940
It's possible that Ryuubi-dono will be attacked
by bandits again if she goes by herself.

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:54.200
How about we go with her
to Kousonsan's place?

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:58.360
Sei-san really likes Ryuubi-san!

00:19:58.360 --> 00:19:59.420
Seems so.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:00.900
Well?

00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:03.880
I think it might be nice to
go on a journey again.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.780
A journey, huh?

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:09.290
That might be nice, yeah...

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:13.350
But before that, we need to do something
about Ryuubi-san's clothing.

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.570
Great!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.220
They fit perfectly.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:27.300
The spares we bought in town yesterday
for Aisha-san came in handy!

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:31.580
Um, is it really OK for you
to even give me clothes?

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.210
Of course. We'll be journeying
together for a while.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.160
Let's be friends.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:38.540
OK!

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:41.680
We're done changing. Let's get going.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.170
Rin Rin, what will you do?

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:45.480
Will you come with us?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.010
Or stay here?

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:50.310
If Aisha is going, I'm going, too!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:53.970
We've sworn a bond of sisterhood, so
we're together wherever we go!

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:55.120
Shuri?

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.700
I'll go with you!

00:20:56.700 --> 00:21:00.900
I was just thinking I'd like to go on a journey
to expand my horizons again.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:07.370
I see. So you want to wander the world,
seeking out new sex positions, huh?

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:13.860
Yes. I'm sure, somewhere out in the wide world,
there exist some we can't even imagine...

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.750
Wait! That's not the only reason I'm going!

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:24.170
By the way, what's a sex position?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:31.130
All right, then take care of
things in our absence.

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:33.510
Yes, we'll be praying for your
well-being on your journey.

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:35.580
Shion and I are stuck here, huh?

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:38.520
We're leaving the village
in your care, Sui, Shion!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.510
Aisha-oneechan, goodbye!

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:44.670
Bring back presents, OK?

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:46.860
Hey, Riri...

00:21:48.860 --> 00:21:49.940
Sui!

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:53.740
Yeah, Rin Rin!

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:55.770
What?

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:57.420
A new kind of staring contest or something?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:02.800
No. When people part, they remember the last
expressions they saw on people's faces.

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:07.350
So I'm showing her a good face,
so she'll remember that!

00:22:07.350 --> 00:22:13.050
And I'm doing the same thing.

00:22:14.010 --> 00:22:16.010
Then I will, as well.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:20.360
Mom, I can't see!

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:25.070
Well? Have you remembered my good face?

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:27.090
Y-Yeah...

00:22:27.550 --> 00:22:31.030
I don't think I'm ever going
to be able to forget it.

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:33.780
Actually, I may even see
it in my dreams tonight.

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:36.230
OK, then let's get going!

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:38.290
Yeah!

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:39.870
Be careful!

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:41.210
Be well, everyone!

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:44.320
We'll be waiting for presents!

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:46.460
Leave it to me!

00:24:26.050 --> 00:24:27.770
Come here, Kousonsan-dono!

00:24:27.770 --> 00:24:29.040
The mic's in the center!

00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:31.110
Here's the script for the preview!

00:24:31.110 --> 00:24:32.640
Is your throat dry?

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:34.690
I have some water if you want it.

00:24:34.690 --> 00:24:38.130
You guys are being so polite, it's creepy.

00:24:39.060 --> 00:24:41.800
Next time on <i>Shin Koihime
Musou,</i> Episode 3:

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:44.830
Kousonsan Fights Enshou!

00:24:44.830 --> 00:24:49.340
Once this fight is over, I'm going
to marry the White Horse...

00:24:49.340 --> 00:24:52.340
Is that a death flag?

00:24:50.170 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Episode 3
Kousonsan Fights Enshou!</b>

00:24:52.340 --> 00:24:55.020
<i>Is it a death flag?</i>

00:24:55.020 --> 00:24:59.930
<b>Watch us again, OK?
And rewatch this episode!</b>
